From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ntoskrnl: the device queue and StartIo.

IoStartNextPacket was a FIXME that did nothing and IoStartPacket,
IoStartNextPacketByKey and IoSetStartIoAttributes were unimplemented.
IoStartPacket calls the driver's StartIo routine at once for an idle device
and otherwise queues the irp (by key when one is given), a cancel routine
given to it stays set while the irp waits; IoStartNextPacket and
IoStartNextPacketByKey start the next queued irp and leave the device idle
when there is none; the deferred attribute keeps StartIo from nesting.
KeInsertByKeyDeviceQueue, KeRemoveByKeyDeviceQueue and
KeRemoveEntryDeviceQueue implemented, and IoCreateDevice initializes the
device's queue.

Gate: test/ntoskrnl-startio-gate.sh.
---

